   "source": [
    "# TransLuxPop / CivitasGrid-TLP: Consolidated Experiments\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook consolidates all experiments from 7 original notebooks into one clean, well-organized codebase.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Experiments Included\n",
    "| § | Experiment | Description |\n",
    "|:-:|:-----------|:------------|\n",
    "| 1 | **Setup** | Imports, seeds, data loading, preprocessing |\n",
    "| 2 | **Utilities** | Splits, metrics, tail computation, contrastive loss |\n",
    "| 3 | **Affine Calibrator** | Trainable calibration layer y' = a·ŷ + b |\n",
    "| 4 | **Contrastive Learning** | XGBoost with custom CL objective, RF with calibration |\n",
    "| 5 | **MoE (MoE)** | Two-expert MoE with body/tail experts and gating |\n",
    "| 6 | **Multi-Baselines** | 7 baselines × (Base / CL / RMSE_CL) variants |\n",
    "| 7 | **Weight Sweep** | Mix-weight sweep (RMSE vs CL weight) |\n",
    "| 8 | **Results & Visualization** | Tables, figures, diagnostics |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os, re, sys, time, random, warnings"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
